{"ticker":"BSX","updated":"2026-11-27T22:41:50Z","profile":{"longName":"Boston Scientific Corporation","shortName":"Boston Scientific Corporation","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Medical Devices","country":"United States","website":"https://www.bostonscientific.com","fullTimeEmployees":59000,"marketCap":65588666368,"trailingPE":19.092829,"forwardPE":14.476479,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.1128936,"pegRatio":0.71,"targetMeanPrice":49.59857,"targetHighPrice":60.0,"targetLowPrice":41.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":28,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.014,"earningsGrowth":-0.215,"grossMargins":0.67977995,"operatingMargins":0.19639,"profitMargins":0.16621,"totalRevenue":21070000128,"beta":0.585,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":101.91,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":39.57,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"Boston Scientific Corporation develops, manufactures, and markets medical devices for use in various interventional medical specialties worldwide. The company operates in two segments, MedSurg and Cardiovascular. It offers devices to diagnose and treat a range of gastrointestinal conditions, such as resolution clips, biliary stent systems, stents and electrocautery enhanced delivery systems, SpyGlass, single-use scopes used for diagnostic and therapeutic procedures in the pancreaticobiliary system, in endoscopic retrograde cholangiopancreatography procedures, and single-use duodenoscopes, as well as endoluminal surgery and infection prevention products; devices to treat urological conditions, including ureteral stents, catheters, baskets, guidewires, urinary and bowel dysfunction, sheaths, balloons, single-use digital flexible ureteroscopes, holmium laser systems, penile implants, artificial urinary sphincter, laser system, and hydrogel systems; and devices to treat neurological movement disorders and manage chronic pain, such as spinal cord stimulator systems, radiofrequency ablation, and intraosseous nerve ablation and deep brain stimulation systems. The company also provides technologies for diagnosing and treating a range of diseases and abnormalities of the heart; WATCHMAN FLX, a left atrial appendage closure (LAAC) device; and implantable devices that monitor the heart an","summary_zh":"波士頓科學公司開發、製造和銷售用於全球各種介入醫學專業的醫療設備。該公司經營兩個部門：醫療外科和心血管部門。該公司提供診斷和治療一系列胃腸道疾病的設備，例如分辨率夾、膽管支架系統、支架和電灼增強輸送系統、SpyGlass、用於胰膽系統診斷和治療程序、內視鏡逆行胰膽管造影程序和一次性十二指腸鏡的一次性示波器，以及腔內手術和感染預防產品；治療泌尿系統疾病的設備，一次性十二指腸鏡的一次性示波器，以及腔內手術和感染預防產品；包括輸尿管支架、導管、籃子、導絲、泌尿和腸道功能障礙、鞘管、球囊、一次性數位輸尿管軟鏡、钬雷射系統、陰莖植入物、人工尿道括約肌、雷射系統和水凝膠系統；以及治療神經運動障礙和控制慢性疼痛的設備，例如脊髓刺激器系統、射頻消融、骨內神經消融和深腦刺激系統。該公司還提供診斷和治療一系列心臟疾病和異常的技術； WATCHMAN FLX，一種左心耳封堵器 (LAAC) 裝置；以及監測心臟的植入式設備","sector_zh":"衛生保健","industry_zh":"醫療器材","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-29","o":98.11,"h":98.48,"l":96.8,"c":97.04,"v":12025300},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":97.35,"h":98.89,"l":95.84,"c":97.63,"v":13273700},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":97.95,"h":99.01,"l":90.69,"c":95.85,"v":22363700},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":95.73,"h":97.25,"l":94.89,"c":96.22,"v":11943300},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":96.16,"h":98.48,"l":96.1,"c":97.32,"v":10768100},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":97.5,"h":97.58,"l":96.07,"c":96.7,"v":7797300},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":96.56,"h":96.73,"l":95.38,"c":95.9,"v":8180400},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":96.29,"h":96.82,"l":95.5,"c":96.79,"v":7135900},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":97.18,"h":97.66,"l":96.68,"c":97.28,"v":7724300},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":97.3,"h":97.78,"l":95.37,"c":95.41,"v":8056000},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":95.13,"h":95.8,"l":94.56,"c":94.95,"v":7105500},{"t":"2025-10-14","o":94.71,"h":96.41,"l":94.53,"c":96.24,"v":6098000},{"t":"2025-10-15","o":95.93,"h":99.61,"l":95.59,"c":97.71,"v":9149300},{"t":"2025-10-16","o":98.01,"h":99.3,"l":97.25,"c":97.78,"v":8221000},{"t":"2025-10-17","o":97.84,"h":99.38,"l":97.53,"c":99.24,"v":6499600},{"t":"2025-10-20","o":99.7,"h":101.02,"l":99.59,"c":100.53,"v":9309700},{"t":"2025-10-21","o":99.83,"h":100.33,"l":99.29,"c":99.9,"v":8955900},{"t":"2025-10-22","o":103.1,"h":105.0,"l":101.52,"c":103.85,"v":17749300},